      "version": "1.0.0",
      "createdAt": 1780814203992,
      "changelog": "xiaozhi-teach-chinese-classical-guide v1.0.0\n\n- Initial release focused on helping Chinese language teachers deliver systematic classical Chinese lessons.\n- Provides structured teaching workflow: guided reading, philology (word/grammar study), summary commentary, theme exploration, cultural context, and modern relevance.\n- Highlights pedagogical boundaries, avoiding full-text translation or annotated content.\n- Supports error-avoidance in teaching (such as discouraging rote memorization and shallow theme labeling).\n- Includes special sections on poetry appreciation, connecting classical texts to students’ lives, and accumulating classical learning archives.",
